      "text": "no-repro: the race window is the few microseconds between handing the answer to the engine and logging approval_resolved, so it does not reproduce on demand in the UI (16 sessions approved at once, 80 tries under CPU contention on this host: 0 hits). It did reproduce in CI on main at cbd8299: approval_allow_runs_the_command saw statuses running, needs_approval, idle (https://github.com/giovaniif/switchyard/actions/runs/43747265198). The base test above shows the order deterministically: when the Claude sidecar reads the answer, approval_resolved is not in the log yet."
    },
